Content-Type: application/json

{"event_id":"7c0e3b2a-5a2f-4f61-9a3e-0d6c1e2b9f10","payment_id":"b1f7a8d4-2c9e-4c1b-8d1f-3e5a7b9c0d12","status":"CAPTURED","amount":1500.00,"currency":"ARS","timestamp":"2026-11-23T14:30:00Z"}

### Evento rezagado: responde RECORDED_ONLY y no pisa el CAPTURED
